      "updated": 1786201299013,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "0.625 in - 0.625 in - 0.500 in, and the U boundary sits in the\nMIDDLE of the 0.500 in gap. Count from a boundary, never from\na hole. Mark your U numbers on the rail with a marker before\nyou mount anything, and the whole class of off-by-one-U\nmistakes disappears.",
      "originalText": "0.625 in - 0.625 in - 0.500 in, and the U boundary sits in the\nMIDDLE of the 0.500 in gap. Count from a boundary, never from\na hole. Mark your U numbers on the rail with a marker before\nyou mount anything, and the whole class of off-by-one-U\nmistakes disappears.",
