      "updated": 1786201571222,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Powder coat is an excellent insulator. A plain\nscrew into a painted rail mounts the equipment\nand bonds nothing. The cabinet reads\ncontinuous to a multimeter through the frame\nand still fails a bond test at the rail.",
      "originalText": "Powder coat is an excellent insulator. A plain screw into a painted rail mounts the equipment and bonds nothing. The cabinet reads continuous to a multimeter through the frame\nand still fails a bond test at the rail.",
