      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Thread-forming screw with a serrated flange, a\npaint-piercing washer, or contact scraped\nclean and treated with antioxidant.  One\ndeliberate bonded path per rail, then the\nframe home-run to the TGB with #6 AWG - see E-\n440.",
      "originalText": "Thread-forming screw with a serrated flange, a paint-piercing washer, or contact scraped clean and treated with antioxidant.  One deliberate bonded path per rail, then the frame home-run to the TGB with #6 AWG - see E-440.",
