      "locked": false,
      "text": "Never use a sheet-metal or self-tapping screw in a rack rail. Machine screws\nonly, into a cage nut or a factory-tapped hole.",
      "originalText": "Never use a sheet-metal or self-tapping screw in a rack rail. Machine screws only, into a cage nut or a factory-tapped hole.",
