      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786201442041,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Torque figures are TYPICAL, for\nuse where the equipment manufacturer\npublishes none. Where the\nmanufacturer does publish a value,\nthat value governs. A calibrated\ndriver is a cheap tool.",
      "originalText": "1. Torque figures are TYPICAL, for use where the equipment manufacturer publishes none. Where the manufacturer does publish a value, that value governs. A calibrated driver is a cheap tool.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 21,
      "versionNonce": 849676314,
      "index": "b4P",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e337",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1700,
      "y": 1426,
      "width": 266.303879777059,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786201464731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Specify square-hole rails and\nstock M6 cage nuts and screws as the\nhouse standard. Keep one bin of 10-32\nfor legacy gear, labeled.",
      "originalText": "2. Specify square-hole rails and stock M6 cage nuts and screws as the house standard. Keep one bin of 10-32 for legacy gear, labeled.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 75,
      "versionNonce": 49958938,
      "index": "b4Q",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e338",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1700,
      "y": 1496,
      "width": 265.40334672417885,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786201469454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Record the rail type and thread in\nthe cabinet documentation. The next\nperson will not be you.",
      "originalText": "3. Record the rail type and thread in the cabinet documentation. The next person will not be you.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
